WEBVTT

01:38.150 --> 01:41.050
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.070 --> 01:43.920
[Episode 21]

01:48.560 --> 01:49.610
His temperament has always been like this.

01:49.610 --> 01:50.870
Don't take it to heart.

01:52.310 --> 01:53.039
No wonder he

01:53.039 --> 01:54.900
kept harping on your case before.

01:55.050 --> 01:55.920
Now that I've seen him in person,

01:55.920 --> 01:57.180
he's really stubborn.

01:58.310 --> 01:59.039
Big Brother.

01:59.120 --> 01:59.560
Big Brother.

01:59.560 --> 02:00.490
Sister-in-law.

02:01.710 --> 02:03.640
Sister-in-law, you're so pretty.

02:03.720 --> 02:06.750
Big Brother, you indeed have g-great taste.

02:09.729 --> 02:10.910
I'm going out for a while.

02:10.910 --> 02:11.680
Keep an eye on that young master

02:11.680 --> 02:12.410
from Huang Residence inside.

02:12.410 --> 02:13.120
Don't let him get away.

02:13.120 --> 02:14.560
Big Brother, rest...

02:14.590 --> 02:15.400
Shut up.

02:16.030 --> 02:17.280
Rest assured, Big Brother.

02:17.280 --> 02:17.810
Let's go.

02:22.910 --> 02:24.170
Where are we going now?

02:24.960 --> 02:25.520
Among the Six Wonders of Guangping,

02:25.520 --> 02:27.480
there are three places left for us to visit.

02:27.480 --> 02:28.960
The Ancient Matchmaking Tree is the nearest.

02:28.960 --> 02:30.160
Let's go there first.

02:30.240 --> 02:30.710
Okay.

02:34.150 --> 02:34.750
This is it.

02:37.630 --> 02:39.430
So this is the Matchmaking Tree.

02:41.030 --> 02:41.750
Looking at it like this,

02:41.750 --> 02:43.410
it doesn't seem that special.

02:46.280 --> 02:47.190
In this world,

02:47.560 --> 02:49.630
most of the famous landmarks

02:50.010 --> 02:51.120
aren't particularly

02:51.120 --> 02:52.320
special themselves.

02:52.800 --> 02:54.800
What truly makes them famous

02:54.910 --> 02:56.510
are the stories behind them.

02:58.800 --> 03:01.790
It's said that during a military rebellion in the previous dynasty,

03:01.790 --> 03:03.750
the Emperor's most beloved Noble Consort

03:03.750 --> 03:04.960
escaped from the palace

03:04.960 --> 03:05.760
and came here.

03:05.840 --> 03:07.590
On the way, she encountered villains

03:07.590 --> 03:08.850
with evil intentions.

03:09.240 --> 03:11.960
The Noble Consort, who was loyal and unyielding, refused to submit

03:11.960 --> 03:14.020
and took her own life under this tree.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.710
To commemorate the Noble Consort,

03:16.710 --> 03:17.800
the Emperor ordered

03:17.800 --> 03:19.030
a tree to be planted here,

03:19.030 --> 03:20.800
embracing this tree

03:21.079 --> 03:22.540
and intertwining with it.

03:22.750 --> 03:24.010
The two trees embrace,

03:24.030 --> 03:25.490
with their roots intertwined

03:25.490 --> 03:27.030
and their branches and leaves intermingled.

03:27.030 --> 03:28.360
The commoners believed

03:28.560 --> 03:29.150
that it was the love between

03:29.150 --> 03:30.680
the Emperor and the Noble Consort

03:30.680 --> 03:32.010
that moved the heavens,

03:32.240 --> 03:34.370
so they named it the Matchmaking Tree,

03:34.800 --> 03:36.530
holding it in great reverence.

03:42.280 --> 03:43.410
I didn't expect that

03:44.630 --> 03:46.680
a place where people come to pray for a good marriage

03:46.680 --> 03:47.590
would have such

03:47.590 --> 03:49.000
a sad story behind it.

03:50.520 --> 03:51.750
This Noble Consort

03:51.960 --> 03:53.760
was truly loyal and unyielding.

03:55.400 --> 03:56.400
You admire her?

03:58.870 --> 03:59.840
Don't you?

04:03.360 --> 04:04.240
I don't know.

04:05.150 --> 04:06.240
I only know that

04:06.400 --> 04:08.000
life is extremely precious.

04:08.710 --> 04:10.750
No matter what happens,

04:11.030 --> 04:13.090
and no matter what problems you encounter,

04:13.090 --> 04:14.630
you should never easily give up

04:14.630 --> 04:15.430
your life.

04:16.360 --> 04:17.920
Why are you so familiar

04:17.940 --> 04:19.070
with this place?

04:20.829 --> 04:22.560
This painting is of Guangping.

04:22.630 --> 04:24.070
I grew up here since childhood,

04:24.070 --> 04:25.930
so of course I'm familiar with it.

04:28.630 --> 04:30.890
So, have you been here with someone else?

04:34.240 --> 04:35.360
I mean, have you ever come here

04:35.360 --> 04:37.890
with someone else to pray for a good marriage?

04:38.390 --> 04:39.190
No, I haven't.

04:42.850 --> 04:43.800
That's good.

04:49.480 --> 04:50.510
What are these?

04:55.360 --> 04:56.830
These are wishing plaques,

04:56.830 --> 04:58.159
used for making wishes.

05:01.600 --> 05:03.000
Do you want to make a wish?

05:06.620 --> 05:08.500
This whole world is fake.

05:08.950 --> 05:10.680
Can wishes made here come true?

05:14.870 --> 05:16.130
It doesn't hurt to try.

05:23.690 --> 05:24.250
Here.

05:26.370 --> 05:29.020
[Safe]

05:52.040 --> 05:53.440
What should I do, Xuanye?

05:53.820 --> 05:54.890
I knocked down

05:54.920 --> 05:56.120
someone else's wish.

06:00.750 --> 06:01.360
How am I supposed to

06:01.290 --> 06:03.410
[Stay true to your heart, and things will work out eventually.
Duan Yingheng]

06:01.360 --> 06:02.800
hang it back up?

06:04.270 --> 06:05.510
Where should I hang it?

06:05.510 --> 06:06.120
Banxia.

06:15.160 --> 06:16.350
Duan Yingheng?

06:18.430 --> 06:20.690
This is indeed my father's handwriting.

06:20.870 --> 06:22.870
It means he's also in this painting.

06:23.080 --> 06:24.080
And look, Xuanye,

06:24.630 --> 06:26.830
he remembers his name is Duan Yingheng.

06:27.920 --> 06:29.240
Doesn't that mean

06:29.310 --> 06:30.040
he's trapped in this painting

06:30.040 --> 06:31.160
just like us?

06:31.800 --> 06:33.659
He must be here somewhere, right?

06:38.710 --> 06:40.510
We're finally about to find him.

06:43.810 --> 06:44.680
Esteemed patrons,

06:44.680 --> 06:46.880
are you here to pray for a good marriage?

06:49.159 --> 06:50.159
Young Taoist.

06:51.120 --> 06:52.630
Have you ever seen this person?

06:52.630 --> 06:54.090
His name is Duan Yingheng.

06:54.870 --> 06:55.830
Duan Yingheng?

06:57.270 --> 06:58.400
I've never seen him.

07:00.630 --> 07:01.190
Right.

07:02.160 --> 07:02.850
There are so many people coming and going.

07:02.850 --> 07:05.250
How could you possibly remember everyone?

07:08.160 --> 07:09.000
Young Taoist,

07:09.390 --> 07:10.850
which temple are you from?

07:10.920 --> 07:13.250
I? I'm from the Sanqing Temple on Mount Yu.

07:15.730 --> 07:17.660
Or maybe I'm from the Bodhi Temple.

07:19.480 --> 07:20.480
The Bodhi Temple?

07:22.160 --> 07:24.120
If it's the Sanqing Temple, it's the Sanqing Temple.

07:24.120 --> 07:25.890
How could you be from the Bodhi Temple as well?

07:25.890 --> 07:27.480
Because I had a dream today.

07:28.550 --> 07:30.720
In that dream, I was a young disciple

07:30.750 --> 07:32.290
of Master Bodhi at the Bodhi Temple

07:32.290 --> 07:34.140
on Mount Bodhi.

07:34.440 --> 07:36.270
That day, my master, Master Bodhi,

07:36.270 --> 07:37.750
set off for Mount Fangyan

07:37.950 --> 07:39.830
to attend the 90th birthday celebration

07:39.830 --> 07:41.270
of the head master of the Fangyan Sect.

07:41.270 --> 07:42.480
But after he left,

07:42.480 --> 07:44.010
he didn't return for a year.

07:44.070 --> 07:45.130
I missed my master,

07:45.630 --> 07:47.400
so I went down the mountain to look for him.

07:47.400 --> 07:49.159
But as soon as I got to Guangping,

07:49.159 --> 07:50.240
I ran out of money.

07:50.740 --> 07:52.800
So I had to enter the city to earn some travel money

07:52.800 --> 07:54.000
by fortune-telling.

07:55.670 --> 07:56.880
But it's just a dream.

07:57.190 --> 07:59.120
It's a dream, yet not a dream.

08:00.160 --> 08:03.090
This is like Zhuangzi dreaming of being a butterfly.

08:05.430 --> 08:07.070
If this really is a dream,

08:07.120 --> 08:08.130
do you hope to be

08:08.160 --> 08:09.830
a young Taoist from the Sanqing Temple

08:09.830 --> 08:11.830
or a disciple from the Bodhi Temple?

08:11.870 --> 08:13.020
It doesn't matter.

08:13.510 --> 08:15.270
I just hope to discard the false and keep the true,

08:15.270 --> 08:17.720
to eliminate the illusory and preserve the real.

08:17.720 --> 08:19.070
Since it's a dream,

08:19.650 --> 08:21.210
how can you distinguish

08:21.340 --> 08:24.270
between truth and falsehood, reality and illusion?

08:26.850 --> 08:29.710
Where this heart finds peace, there lies the truth.

08:30.840 --> 08:33.270
Young Taoist, your words are full of Zen wisdom.

08:33.270 --> 08:34.070
I'm inspired.

08:35.960 --> 08:36.890
You're too kind.

08:39.630 --> 08:40.789
If you don't mind,

08:41.390 --> 08:44.990
could you help this humble Taoist with the first deal of this day?

08:50.790 --> 08:51.720
Is this enough?

08:53.870 --> 08:54.590
Kind lady.

08:54.910 --> 08:55.390
This bracelet

08:55.390 --> 08:57.670
is worth 100 times of fortune telling from me.

08:57.670 --> 08:59.330
The matter I want you to divine

08:59.600 --> 09:00.730
is worth this price.

09:01.360 --> 09:03.960
May I ask what kind of fortune you seek to be told, kind lady?

09:03.960 --> 09:05.220
Family relationship.

09:11.950 --> 09:14.080
Could you please explain the divination to me?

09:14.080 --> 09:16.120
The time of adversity is ending, and good fortune is coming.

09:16.120 --> 09:17.920
Shake off the dust from your body

09:18.360 --> 09:20.360
and get rid of the dark grime on your body.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.480
Especially during the hours of Mao and Yin, which is 5 to 7 am,

09:22.480 --> 09:23.720
good news will come.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.720
By then, the broken mirror will be mended,

09:25.720 --> 09:27.000
and those who are separated

09:27.000 --> 09:28.330
will surely meet again.

09:30.240 --> 09:31.640
Thank you, young Taoist.

09:32.630 --> 09:35.890
Gentleman, is there anything you want me to divine for you?

09:36.030 --> 09:36.510
I don't.

09:39.660 --> 09:41.170
There's a Matchmaking Tree here.

09:41.170 --> 09:42.100
I'll divine

09:42.130 --> 09:44.730
your marital fortune for you then, gentleman.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.450
Please, gentleman.

10:02.300 --> 10:03.840
The mirror is broken, and the wind doesn't cease.

10:03.840 --> 10:05.400
Don't sail against the current.

10:05.400 --> 10:08.260
Gentleman, this divination is very inauspicious.

10:09.700 --> 10:11.210
Don't take what that young Taoist

10:11.210 --> 10:12.530
said just now to heart.

10:13.020 --> 10:14.830
He's young and lacks experience,

10:14.830 --> 10:16.890
so his divination can be inaccurate.

10:16.960 --> 10:18.390
Let's not talk about him anymore.

10:18.390 --> 10:19.150
At least we discovered

10:19.150 --> 10:20.720
your father's handwriting.

10:20.720 --> 10:22.380
That's quite an achievement.

10:22.720 --> 10:23.320
Yes.

10:23.660 --> 10:25.390
As long as we can confirm he's in the painting,

10:25.390 --> 10:27.390
finding him is just a matter of time.

10:28.910 --> 10:30.390
There are two more places to visit.

10:30.390 --> 10:31.850
I'm sure we'll find clues.

10:33.020 --> 10:33.570
If we

10:33.600 --> 10:35.090
can find a way out,

10:35.450 --> 10:36.760
does that mean

10:36.790 --> 10:37.670
the other people

10:37.670 --> 10:39.870
trapped in the painting can get out too?

10:39.870 --> 10:41.510
Then that young Taoist we just met

10:41.510 --> 10:42.480
could return to the Bodhi Temple

10:42.480 --> 10:43.480
to see his master.

10:46.840 --> 10:47.600
Actually,

10:48.770 --> 10:49.650
60 years ago,

10:50.270 --> 10:52.070
there was a flood on Mount Bodhi.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.650
His master and the entire temple

10:56.220 --> 10:58.020
have long since turned to rubble

10:58.030 --> 10:59.030
and disappeared.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.480
Sixty years have passed,

11:03.260 --> 11:04.720
yet he knows nothing of it.

11:05.930 --> 11:08.590
He must have been in the painting for a long time.

11:09.390 --> 11:10.720
The world in this painting

11:10.720 --> 11:11.840
repeats in cycles,

11:12.390 --> 11:13.550
but the time outside

11:13.570 --> 11:14.900
flows on relentlessly.

11:15.630 --> 11:17.890
Once this place collapses and shatters,

11:18.080 --> 11:19.480
he will instantly age

11:20.440 --> 11:21.570
and turn from a child

11:21.910 --> 11:22.870
into an old man.

11:24.670 --> 11:26.130
If that's really the case,

11:26.650 --> 11:27.310
I'm not sure

11:27.320 --> 11:29.520
whether it's better for him to stay here

11:29.960 --> 11:31.320
or to get away.

11:32.510 --> 11:33.870
If he stays here,

11:34.320 --> 11:35.790
at least he still has hope and

11:35.790 --> 11:37.600
something to look forward to every day.

11:37.600 --> 11:39.320
But if he really gets away,

11:40.150 --> 11:42.270
it would be like waking from a long dream to nothing.

11:42.270 --> 11:44.200
His life would already be at its end

11:44.440 --> 11:46.570
before he could experience anything.

11:54.950 --> 11:55.810
Junior Sister?

11:57.240 --> 11:58.700
Go inform Master quickly.

11:59.550 --> 12:00.410
-Hurry!
-Okay.

12:07.450 --> 12:10.300
[Fa'en Temple]

12:11.620 --> 12:12.960
The incense offerings at Fa'en Temple

12:12.960 --> 12:14.290
are really prosperous.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.550
The Emperor believes in Buddhism.

12:16.550 --> 12:17.750
Plus, this place

12:17.750 --> 12:19.210
once witnessed a miracle.

12:19.270 --> 12:20.080
That's why there are

12:20.080 --> 12:21.430
more people coming here.

12:21.430 --> 12:22.630
What kind of miracle?

12:24.210 --> 12:26.060
Years ago, there was a severe drought in Guangping.

12:26.060 --> 12:27.890
Not a drop of rain fell for four consecutive months.

12:27.890 --> 12:29.870
The people's lives were in dire straits.

12:29.870 --> 12:31.030
So the wealthy people in the city,

12:31.030 --> 12:32.790
led by the prefect,

12:33.750 --> 12:35.240
came to Fa'en Temple

12:35.790 --> 12:36.630
on the day of the Flower Festival

12:36.630 --> 12:39.760
to pray for rain before the Guanyin Bodhisattva statue.

12:40.200 --> 12:41.550
Just as the ceremony began,

12:41.550 --> 12:43.150
an odd phenomenon occurred.

12:43.240 --> 12:44.870
The Guanyin Bodhisattva's statue was seen shedding tears,

12:44.870 --> 12:45.930
thunder gathered,

12:46.410 --> 12:48.870
and suddenly a torrential rain poured down.

12:50.240 --> 12:51.570
After that spring rain,

12:51.960 --> 12:53.620
flowers bloomed everywhere.

12:54.080 --> 12:55.320
The commoners believed

12:55.320 --> 12:56.960
it was the compassion of Guanyin Bodhisattva

12:56.960 --> 12:58.560
that brought the sweet rain.

12:58.630 --> 13:00.500
So they designated the Flower Festival

13:00.500 --> 13:01.620
as the Temple Fair Day.

13:01.620 --> 13:02.510
Devout men and women

13:02.510 --> 13:03.570
all come on this day

13:03.720 --> 13:06.850
to Fa'en Temple to offer incense and pray for blessings.

13:06.960 --> 13:08.030
I see.

13:10.080 --> 13:10.600
But don't you think

13:10.600 --> 13:11.410
searching like this

13:11.410 --> 13:12.540
is leading nowhere?

13:13.430 --> 13:14.510
Since my father remembers

13:14.510 --> 13:15.680
his name,

13:15.720 --> 13:17.720
he should remember my voice as well.

13:17.870 --> 13:19.000
Let's shout around.

13:19.210 --> 13:20.000
If he hears it,

13:20.000 --> 13:21.600
he will respond to me, right?

13:22.270 --> 13:23.200
I guess so.

13:29.270 --> 13:30.910
Quick, go after them!

13:30.940 --> 13:32.010
Hurry up, let's go!

13:33.000 --> 13:33.460
Master.

13:37.910 --> 13:39.030
Father!

13:39.390 --> 13:40.630
I'm Banxia!

13:40.630 --> 13:42.390
Where are you?

13:42.840 --> 13:43.790
Father!

13:44.440 --> 13:45.390
Father!

13:48.120 --> 13:48.580
Master.

13:48.880 --> 13:50.320
It sounds like Junior Sister's voice.

13:50.320 --> 13:52.180
Quick, quick, go search!

14:02.730 --> 14:05.580
I forgot that I know the Lion's Roar technique.

14:11.840 --> 14:12.900
You evil creature!

14:17.080 --> 14:17.600
Father?

14:18.170 --> 14:19.080
I don't have such

14:19.080 --> 14:20.680
an unfilial daughter as you!

14:21.970 --> 14:23.230
So this is your father?

14:23.850 --> 14:24.590
No, not really.

14:24.590 --> 14:26.390
He's my father in this painting.

14:27.600 --> 14:28.600
Go get her!

14:28.840 --> 14:29.240
Go!

14:29.960 --> 14:31.210
Quick, quick!

14:34.380 --> 14:36.440
You evil creature, stop right there!

14:37.150 --> 14:37.840
Stop!

14:38.150 --> 14:39.030
You evil creature!

14:39.030 --> 14:39.600
Stop!

14:40.720 --> 14:42.320
You can't pass through here.

14:42.600 --> 14:43.080
You all,

14:43.440 --> 14:44.100
go that way.

14:44.240 --> 14:45.090
Let's go this way.

14:45.090 --> 14:46.090
Let's go, Master.

14:49.670 --> 14:50.800
Follow me! This way!

14:51.910 --> 14:52.910
Come on, this way!

14:57.390 --> 14:58.600
Go check the east side.

14:58.600 --> 14:59.000
Yes.

16:05.150 --> 16:05.750
Master!

16:15.480 --> 16:17.010
How did it go? Did you find her?

16:17.010 --> 16:17.840
We've searched the courtyard,

16:17.840 --> 16:18.550
but we didn't see Junior Sister.

16:18.550 --> 16:20.150
No luck on this side, either.

16:21.160 --> 16:22.360
How is that possible?

16:22.440 --> 16:24.170
I clearly saw her in the temple.

16:24.420 --> 16:25.200
Go search again.

16:25.200 --> 16:25.750
Be more thorough.

16:25.750 --> 16:26.720
-Go.
-Yes.

16:26.910 --> 16:27.600
Let's go.

16:33.440 --> 16:34.970
What were you running from?

16:36.440 --> 16:37.750
They were chasing me.

16:38.790 --> 16:39.910
Aren't you skilled in martial arts?

16:39.910 --> 16:41.770
Can't you just fight your way out?

16:42.120 --> 16:43.320
But that's my father.

16:44.320 --> 16:45.910
He's just your father in the painting.

16:45.910 --> 16:47.310
But he's still my father.

16:51.580 --> 16:52.110
Master!

16:53.750 --> 16:54.480
How did it go?

16:54.800 --> 16:55.750
We've searched until there were no more paths

16:55.750 --> 16:57.330
and still haven't seen Junior Sister.

16:57.330 --> 16:58.000
That's impossible.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.600
She must be somewhere in this temple.

16:59.600 --> 17:00.840
There are no more doors in the backyard.

17:00.840 --> 17:01.970
There's only one...

17:02.630 --> 17:03.410
Dog hole left.

17:03.410 --> 17:04.010
Nonsense!

17:05.310 --> 17:07.710
How could my daughter go through a dog hole?

17:08.750 --> 17:09.880
Go look again, quickly.

17:09.880 --> 17:10.270
Yes.

17:11.000 --> 17:11.530
Let's go!

17:11.680 --> 17:12.160
Go.

17:21.480 --> 17:22.310
Quick, quick, hide!

17:22.310 --> 17:23.310
How could this be?

17:28.720 --> 17:30.310
I just don't believe it.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.480
They've all left.

17:46.270 --> 17:47.400
So, can you

17:47.510 --> 17:48.370
let go of me now?

17:48.720 --> 17:49.440
No.

17:49.960 --> 17:51.030
What if they come back later?

17:51.030 --> 17:52.030
What should we do?

17:53.790 --> 17:55.510
Can't you move back a bit?

17:55.750 --> 17:57.760
There's still so much space behind you.

17:57.760 --> 17:59.620
Do you have to squeeze in so close?

18:00.110 --> 18:00.790
I can't.

18:01.970 --> 18:03.100
If I move back any more,

18:03.100 --> 18:04.310
they'll see us.

18:04.810 --> 18:05.730
Just bear with it a little longer.

18:05.730 --> 18:07.390
Hold on a bit longer, alright?

18:24.540 --> 18:26.170
Another fruitless search.

18:26.730 --> 18:27.730
I wonder where he

18:27.760 --> 18:28.610
put them in the painting.

18:28.610 --> 18:29.750
The rain is getting heavier.

18:29.750 --> 18:30.610
Let's hurry up.

18:32.350 --> 18:33.310
Go, quickly.

18:36.410 --> 18:37.110
Do you remember

18:37.110 --> 18:39.350
everything the teacher taught you today?

18:39.350 --> 18:39.920
Xuanye.

18:43.200 --> 18:44.240
[Ganshan Clinic]

18:43.610 --> 18:46.490
♫A familiar figure♫

18:46.970 --> 18:50.080
♫Becomes clear in the haze♫

18:50.610 --> 18:55.040
♫Yet it's out of reach♫

18:57.460 --> 19:00.440
♫Your earnest reminders♫

19:00.960 --> 19:03.790
♫And words of concern♫

19:04.540 --> 19:10.690
♫They've woven and colored the time we shared♫

19:06.160 --> 19:08.590
Heaven and Earth, profound and yellow.

19:09.160 --> 19:11.830
The universe, vast and wild.

19:11.440 --> 19:14.460
♫Traces of a bond♫

19:12.720 --> 19:14.920
Cold and heat, come and go.

19:14.930 --> 19:17.940
♫With a sigh, we bid farewell♫

19:15.830 --> 19:18.200
Harvest in autumn, store in winter.

19:18.420 --> 19:23.940
♫Keeping you company, and seeing you off on a long journey♫

19:20.880 --> 19:22.680
Are you trying to drive me crazy?

19:23.400 --> 19:24.200
Listen again.

19:25.090 --> 19:28.240
♫You're the same as before♫

19:25.880 --> 19:28.590
Heaven and Earth, profound and yellow.

19:28.730 --> 19:32.190
♫And I'm still following closely behind♫

19:30.030 --> 19:32.510
The universe, vast and wild.

19:32.360 --> 19:37.960
♫Remember it day and night♫

19:32.790 --> 19:33.480
You say it.

19:34.590 --> 19:35.960
The universe...

19:36.350 --> 19:37.680
The universe...

19:38.350 --> 19:40.240
The universe, same and wild?

19:38.830 --> 19:40.610
♫One side is the past♫

19:40.640 --> 19:44.940
♫Where you lingered♫

19:41.590 --> 19:44.200
It's vast. Vast and wild.

19:44.590 --> 19:45.880
How many times have I taught you?

19:45.690 --> 19:47.440
♫The other is the unforgettable♫

19:45.920 --> 19:47.250
Why can't you remember?

19:47.470 --> 19:51.440
♫Dream of mine♫

19:51.270 --> 19:52.070
Let me ask you,

19:52.240 --> 19:53.000
what's your mother's name?

19:52.750 --> 19:55.850
♫A fallen leaf, a drop of wine♫

19:53.590 --> 19:54.590
Hong Ning.

19:55.160 --> 19:56.070
That's right.

19:56.210 --> 19:58.960
♫Each drop into my heart♫

19:56.550 --> 19:58.720
The universe, vast and wild. It pronounces "hong huang."

19:58.720 --> 20:00.510
It's the character "hong" from your mother's name.

19:59.730 --> 20:05.130
♫A moment of memory, an illusion♫

20:00.960 --> 20:01.890
Recite it again.

20:02.160 --> 20:05.710
Heaven and Earth, profound and yellow.

20:06.060 --> 20:12.870
♫A segment of reminiscence engraved for a lifetime♫

20:06.270 --> 20:08.640
The universe, mother and wild.

20:10.400 --> 20:12.130
What on earth are you reciting?

20:12.200 --> 20:13.030
Mother.

20:15.030 --> 20:16.260
Give him a break.

20:16.720 --> 20:17.920
You rarely come back.

20:18.240 --> 20:19.900
You should speak more kindly.

20:20.270 --> 20:20.920
Didn't you hear

20:20.920 --> 20:22.200
what he just said?

20:23.400 --> 20:24.810
Pretending to go to school all day,

20:23.900 --> 20:25.660
♫One side is the past♫

20:25.030 --> 20:26.110
and this is all he's learned?

20:25.690 --> 20:29.970
♫Where you lingered♫

20:26.510 --> 20:27.370
It's all a mess!

20:28.680 --> 20:30.540
You never take care of him normally.

20:30.540 --> 20:31.260
You finally came back,

20:30.880 --> 20:32.470
♫The other is the unforgettable♫

20:31.400 --> 20:32.830
yet you got so angry with the kid.

20:32.510 --> 20:36.220
♫Dream of mine♫

20:33.270 --> 20:35.000
Stop with the posturing, okay?

20:36.070 --> 20:36.880
Xi'er, good boy.

20:36.880 --> 20:37.740
Let's stop studying.

20:37.740 --> 20:40.810
♫A fallen leaf, a drop of wine♫

20:38.160 --> 20:39.790
Come on, let's go to the kitchen.

20:39.790 --> 20:41.260
I'll make you something delicious.

20:41.260 --> 20:44.330
♫Each drop into my heart♫

20:41.790 --> 20:42.270
Come on.

20:42.550 --> 20:44.270
It's vast. Vast and wild.

20:44.510 --> 20:45.480
Alright, stop it.

20:44.740 --> 20:50.280
♫A moment of memory, an illusion♫

20:45.480 --> 20:47.000
Vast. Vast and wild. Vast.

20:51.450 --> 20:57.120
♫A segment of reminiscence engraved for a lifetime♫

20:56.830 --> 20:58.590
Are you two here to see a doctor?

21:06.330 --> 21:08.120
I... I need to see a doctor.

21:20.520 --> 21:21.150
Young man.

21:22.410 --> 21:23.280
Do you have some kind of

21:23.280 --> 21:24.070
eye disease?

21:27.780 --> 21:28.210
I...

21:28.750 --> 21:30.010
I'm the one who's sick.

21:33.580 --> 21:34.910
What are your symptoms?

21:37.750 --> 21:38.310
I...

21:39.160 --> 21:41.370
I have difficulty eating lately.

21:42.450 --> 21:44.540
I feel dizzy and anxious.

21:44.560 --> 21:45.800
I also...

21:47.800 --> 21:49.400
You have difficulty eating,

21:51.310 --> 21:53.040
and you feel anxious and dizzy?

21:53.230 --> 21:53.800
Yes.

21:56.380 --> 21:57.510
That shouldn't be.

21:58.790 --> 21:59.510
Young lady,

21:59.830 --> 22:01.000
your pulse

22:01.640 --> 22:03.590
is strong and steady.

22:04.030 --> 22:05.230
With all due respect,

22:05.440 --> 22:07.550
you seem like a trained martial artist.

22:07.550 --> 22:08.640
I really don't see

22:08.640 --> 22:09.550
any symptoms.

22:19.260 --> 22:20.130
Did you two take

22:20.150 --> 22:21.750
money from Changping Clinic

22:21.910 --> 22:23.510
to come and cause me trouble?

22:23.950 --> 22:24.580
No.

22:24.770 --> 22:26.500
I really am here to see a doctor.

22:27.780 --> 22:30.180
I've been having trouble sleeping lately,

22:30.570 --> 22:32.570
and now I have splitting headaches.

22:33.130 --> 22:34.430
I've been to many clinics,

22:34.430 --> 22:35.420
but nothing has worked.

22:35.420 --> 22:37.320
I heard your medical skills are excellent,

22:37.320 --> 22:38.630
so I wanted you

22:38.660 --> 22:40.590
to prescribe some medicine for me.

22:43.410 --> 22:44.210
Alright then.

22:44.310 --> 22:45.400
I'll prescribe you

22:45.910 --> 22:48.160
a formula to calm your nerves and help you sleep.

22:48.160 --> 22:48.680
Okay.

22:57.760 --> 22:58.360
Remember.

22:58.790 --> 23:00.440
Simmer over low heat.

23:01.390 --> 23:04.210
When three bowls of water have been reduced to one,

23:04.240 --> 23:05.500
the medicine is ready.

23:06.110 --> 23:07.240
Take one dose daily.

23:07.910 --> 23:09.040
Don't take too much.

23:13.680 --> 23:14.340
Here you go.

23:15.000 --> 23:16.660
This is the consultation fee.

23:19.340 --> 23:20.270
This is too much.

23:21.310 --> 23:22.440
It's not necessary.

23:23.200 --> 23:23.930
Take it back.

23:24.490 --> 23:25.170
How about this?

23:25.170 --> 23:27.300
You can pay the rest next time you come.

23:27.880 --> 23:28.410
Alright.

23:29.060 --> 23:30.190
Go get the medicine.

23:36.720 --> 23:39.380
Do you two have any other ailments to be treated?

23:41.380 --> 23:43.400
I'd like to buy some medicinal herbs.

23:43.400 --> 23:44.460
What kind of herbs?

23:45.650 --> 23:47.650
Thunder-marked Cinnabar, Thousand-step Peak,

23:47.650 --> 23:48.780
Moon Bug Insect Oil,

23:49.340 --> 23:50.940
and Sandalwood Incense Ash.

23:55.310 --> 23:55.970
Here you go.

23:56.350 --> 23:58.160
Here's the Thunder-marked Cinnabar, Thousand-step Peak

23:58.160 --> 23:59.510
and Sandalwood Incense Ash you asked for.

23:59.510 --> 24:00.770
I'll put it on your tab.

24:01.270 --> 24:03.670
But this Moon Bug Insect Oil you mentioned,

24:03.950 --> 24:05.610
I've never heard of it before.

24:06.680 --> 24:08.010
You haven't heard of it?

24:11.540 --> 24:12.260
Young man,

24:12.970 --> 24:14.630
what exactly is this Moon Bug?

24:15.600 --> 24:17.530
Is it also a tool for demon hunting?

24:17.580 --> 24:18.590
Do you have any on you?

24:18.590 --> 24:19.520
Can I take a look?

24:24.560 --> 24:25.760
I don't have any on me.

24:26.210 --> 24:28.070
That's why I came here to buy some.

24:31.490 --> 24:32.820
I didn't expect that

24:33.210 --> 24:34.650
at such a young age,

24:34.760 --> 24:36.960
you'd be in the same line of work with me.

24:36.970 --> 24:39.370
May I ask which school or sect you belong to?

24:42.280 --> 24:43.670
I learned from my father.

24:43.670 --> 24:45.000
We practiced together.

24:45.400 --> 24:46.460
That's wonderful,

24:46.900 --> 24:48.830
carrying on the family tradition.

24:49.590 --> 24:51.190
May I ask your father's name?

24:51.480 --> 24:52.590
Perhaps I know him.

24:55.090 --> 24:56.410
You wouldn't.

24:57.550 --> 24:58.660
He has passed away.

24:59.850 --> 25:00.520
I'm sorry.

25:00.630 --> 25:01.350
Honey,

25:01.760 --> 25:03.390
dinner's ready. Let's eat.

25:06.380 --> 25:08.200
We won't disturb you any further.

25:08.200 --> 25:09.210
We'll take our leave.

25:09.210 --> 25:09.820
See you.

25:10.580 --> 25:11.580
Come on, let's go.

25:16.030 --> 25:16.790
What's wrong?

25:16.790 --> 25:19.110
My... My stomach hurts so much.

25:20.510 --> 25:21.960
I don't know if it's because

25:21.960 --> 25:24.200
I haven't eaten for too long.

25:25.250 --> 25:26.010
Ma'am.

25:26.480 --> 25:28.560
Would it be too much trouble

25:28.590 --> 25:30.450
if I had a quick meal at your place?

25:33.050 --> 25:33.920
Of course not.

25:34.170 --> 25:36.230
It's no problem. Let's eat together.

25:36.400 --> 25:37.400
Come on, let's go.

25:37.440 --> 25:38.570
Let's eat together.

25:38.720 --> 25:39.160
Let's go.

25:39.160 --> 25:40.110
Thank you for your trouble.

25:40.110 --> 25:41.370
It's no trouble at all.

25:46.550 --> 25:47.030
Come on.

25:47.680 --> 25:48.810
Please, have a seat.

25:50.240 --> 25:52.430
Alright, everyone's hungry. Let's eat.

25:52.430 --> 25:54.110
These are just some simple home-cooked dishes.

25:54.110 --> 25:55.310
I hope you don't mind.

25:55.590 --> 25:56.450
Please, eat up.

26:07.580 --> 26:08.380
Is it not good?

26:10.200 --> 26:11.130
It's delicious.

26:13.180 --> 26:13.880
This is my homemade

26:13.880 --> 26:15.080
pickled vegetables.

26:15.470 --> 26:17.530
It probably doesn't suit your taste.

26:17.750 --> 26:19.350
Here, have a chicken leg.

26:19.400 --> 26:21.070
I bought it from Li's Smoked Meat Shop.

26:21.070 --> 26:22.270
It's very delicious.

26:22.440 --> 26:23.350
It really is.

26:23.880 --> 26:24.880
When I was little,

26:25.070 --> 26:26.240
what I ate most often

26:26.510 --> 26:27.030
was the pickled vegetables

26:27.030 --> 26:28.230
my mother made for me.

26:29.440 --> 26:30.720
Since she passed away,

26:31.360 --> 26:31.930
I haven't

26:31.960 --> 26:33.420
tasted this flavor again.

26:34.550 --> 26:35.310
I see.

26:36.360 --> 26:37.800
If you like it, eat more.

26:38.030 --> 26:39.430
There's more in the kitchen.

26:39.430 --> 26:40.430
If you don't mind,

26:40.720 --> 26:42.580
take some with you when you leave.

26:43.960 --> 26:46.200
Brother, you can take it all.

26:46.220 --> 26:48.150
I don't like it anyway.

26:50.880 --> 26:52.440
He's so clever and adorable.

26:52.440 --> 26:54.270
He'll surely be successful in the future.

26:54.270 --> 26:55.750
He doesn't have to be successful.

26:55.750 --> 26:56.550
I don't have any expectations

26:56.550 --> 26:57.750
for this little brat.

26:58.310 --> 26:59.710
As long as he can pass down

26:59.790 --> 27:00.850
the Ganshan Clinic

27:01.400 --> 27:02.680
and ensure my demon-hunting skills

27:02.680 --> 27:04.340
don't die out, that's enough.

27:06.440 --> 27:07.270
I can tell at a glance

27:07.270 --> 27:08.930
that you're a blessed person.

27:09.030 --> 27:10.640
Not to mention passing the business down,

27:10.640 --> 27:11.440
he might even

27:11.440 --> 27:13.110
surpass you one day.

27:15.790 --> 27:17.510
This young lady sure knows how to talk.

27:17.510 --> 27:18.790
If that's really the case,

27:18.790 --> 27:20.720
I'd wake up from my dream laughing.

27:21.790 --> 27:22.720
But if you laugh,

27:23.070 --> 27:24.030
I might cry.

27:24.680 --> 27:25.700
In this line of work,

27:25.700 --> 27:27.350
it's all about fighting, killing,

27:27.350 --> 27:29.150
and dealing with demons all day.

27:29.840 --> 27:30.440
I don't want

27:30.440 --> 27:31.570
my son to do this job.

27:32.200 --> 27:33.140
If you ask me,

27:33.510 --> 27:35.310
as long as the family is together

27:35.550 --> 27:38.010
and safe, that's better than anything else.

27:53.040 --> 27:55.370
You two just got married recently, right?

27:55.430 --> 27:56.760
We're not married.

27:56.790 --> 27:57.920
We're just friends.

28:01.020 --> 28:02.150
Don't try to fool me.

28:02.680 --> 28:03.680
I can tell.

28:05.680 --> 28:06.960
Tell what?

28:07.750 --> 28:09.070
I can tell that

28:10.110 --> 28:11.570
you two are deeply in love,

28:11.920 --> 28:13.050
and you're a couple.

28:16.000 --> 28:16.680
Anyway,

28:17.480 --> 28:18.880
you definitely like him.

28:19.650 --> 28:20.300
Later,

28:20.640 --> 28:22.100
we left the South Sea.

28:23.030 --> 28:24.110
He's a good guy.

28:26.590 --> 28:27.790
I think so too.

28:30.330 --> 28:31.930
You've been to the South Sea?

28:33.160 --> 28:34.610
My father took me there.

28:35.550 --> 28:37.420
There's a type of demon in the South Sea

28:37.420 --> 28:39.070
called the Dead Leaf Butterfly.

28:39.070 --> 28:41.400
It's huge, with wings like cattail sails.

28:41.980 --> 28:42.850
This demon

28:42.970 --> 28:44.570
is best at weaving illusions

28:44.710 --> 28:46.300
and bewitching people's minds.

28:46.300 --> 28:47.450
The first time my father and I

28:47.450 --> 28:48.790
encountered this demon,

28:48.790 --> 28:49.920
we fell for its trick

28:50.070 --> 28:51.600
and fell into its illusion.

28:51.760 --> 28:53.160
We almost lost our minds.

28:53.960 --> 28:54.960
But fortunately,

28:55.160 --> 28:56.690
in the end, my father woke up

28:56.780 --> 28:58.040
and slayed that demon.

28:58.840 --> 29:01.320
Actually, the illusions in this world,

29:02.360 --> 29:03.830
although they may seem mysterious

29:03.830 --> 29:04.960
and extraordinary,

29:05.140 --> 29:07.140
they all follow the same principle.

29:07.480 --> 29:08.790
As long as you find the right focal point,

29:08.790 --> 29:10.450
they can be easily dispelled.

29:11.110 --> 29:13.000
People trapped in illusions

29:13.140 --> 29:14.550
are like turtles in a jar,

29:14.780 --> 29:15.850
or birds in a cage.

29:16.030 --> 29:18.200
Of course it's hard for them to break free.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.830
But if viewed from the outside,

29:19.830 --> 29:21.630
they're like flowers in a mirror

29:21.640 --> 29:22.960
or reflections in the water.

29:22.960 --> 29:24.020
With a gentle poke,

29:24.400 --> 29:26.200
they'd dissipate like bubbles.

29:28.160 --> 29:29.720
So you mean,

29:30.000 --> 29:31.480
to break the illusion,

29:31.800 --> 29:33.790
we need to attack from both inside and outside?

29:33.790 --> 29:34.850
You could say that.

29:35.680 --> 29:37.920
The focal points can be divided into two types.

29:37.920 --> 29:38.880
One connects

29:38.900 --> 29:41.100
the door between reality and illusion.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.700
By passing through it,

29:42.790 --> 29:44.390
one can escape the illusion.

29:44.880 --> 29:45.930
The other type

29:46.070 --> 29:47.510
is the person who cast the formation.

29:47.510 --> 29:48.570
As long as they die,

29:48.880 --> 29:51.480
the formation will dissipate along with them.

29:54.000 --> 29:55.070
Dad, look!

29:55.070 --> 29:56.460
I've learned

29:56.640 --> 29:58.370
the Bahuang Fist you taught me.

30:01.590 --> 30:02.190
Young man.

30:02.820 --> 30:04.640
This is our family's ancestral  Bahuang Fist.

30:04.640 --> 30:06.500
Would you like to learn it from me?

30:10.440 --> 30:11.000
Sure.

30:40.830 --> 30:42.360
You're in a good mood today.

30:43.850 --> 30:45.240
I practiced a set of fist techniques,

30:45.240 --> 30:46.970
and it made me feel much better.

30:48.080 --> 30:48.720
Why are your parents

30:48.720 --> 30:50.240
in the painting as well?

30:52.440 --> 30:54.000
That demon must have spent

30:54.030 --> 30:55.490
many years painting this.

30:55.590 --> 30:57.120
It painted whatever it saw.

30:57.370 --> 30:58.100
For example,

30:58.400 --> 30:59.840
the Six Wonders of Guangping

30:59.840 --> 31:00.550
couldn't possibly have

31:00.550 --> 31:01.810
taken place in one day,

31:02.070 --> 31:03.480
but since the painter

31:03.480 --> 31:04.720
was deeply impressed,

31:04.720 --> 31:05.850
it painted them all.

31:07.390 --> 31:09.000
But if it could paint,

31:09.540 --> 31:13.140
why did it have to capture living people to put into the painting?

31:13.240 --> 31:15.510
I'm also puzzled by this.

31:20.270 --> 31:20.900
Perhaps

31:21.270 --> 31:22.960
only by meeting the painter in person

31:22.960 --> 31:24.160
can we get the answer.

31:47.550 --> 31:48.160
Let's go.

32:02.680 --> 32:04.070
How are you feeling today?

32:04.070 --> 32:04.800
Much better.

32:05.950 --> 32:07.880
Thank you for taking me in, Master.

32:08.240 --> 32:09.920
Since Mr. Jiu sent you here,

32:10.210 --> 32:11.070
of course Xiaodongtian has no reason

32:11.070 --> 32:12.000
to turn you away.

32:12.160 --> 32:13.860
Just rest and recuperate here.

32:13.860 --> 32:15.190
When you fully recover,

32:15.380 --> 32:17.710
you can find another place to settle down.

32:32.280 --> 32:34.080
Lady, please line up at the back.

32:44.030 --> 32:45.690
I require to see your manager.

32:49.750 --> 32:51.390
I'm here on the orders of the Minister of the Court of Judicial Review,

32:51.390 --> 32:52.950
Lord Song Zhilian,

32:53.070 --> 32:53.750
to investigate

32:53.750 --> 32:56.000
the case of Lord Xin'an's disappearance.

32:56.000 --> 32:57.260
Since you are well-established in the Underground City,

32:57.260 --> 32:59.430
having been doing business here for a long time,

32:59.430 --> 33:00.760
I wonder if you could

33:00.880 --> 33:02.340
provide assistance to me.

33:02.720 --> 33:03.720
Assisting the government with case investigation

33:03.720 --> 33:05.200
is Xiaodongtian's duty.

33:05.350 --> 33:06.510
However, My Lord,

33:07.160 --> 33:08.220
do you have any leads

33:08.220 --> 33:10.280
on where to start the investigation?

33:12.590 --> 33:13.790
Two years ago, Lord Xin'an

33:13.790 --> 33:14.720
came to the Underground City

33:14.720 --> 33:15.780
with an old servant

33:16.110 --> 33:17.250
to see the Living Healer,

33:17.250 --> 33:18.850
Huangfu Bai, for treatment.

33:19.110 --> 33:20.590
According to Huangfu Bai's diagnosis,

33:20.590 --> 33:21.880
he was found to have a blood-borne disease

33:21.880 --> 33:23.240
and didn't have long to live.

33:23.240 --> 33:24.480
However, after that,

33:24.880 --> 33:26.610
he didn't return to the capital

33:27.000 --> 33:29.800
and disappeared in the Underground City instead.

33:31.680 --> 33:32.430
Lord Sima.

33:32.720 --> 33:33.920
With all due respect,

33:35.110 --> 33:36.920
since His Lordship was already terminally ill

33:36.920 --> 33:38.510
and it's been two years,

33:38.750 --> 33:39.680
even if we find him,

33:39.680 --> 33:41.940
he will probably be beyond recognition.

33:42.720 --> 33:44.380
That's not for you to worry about.

33:44.380 --> 33:45.820
You're well aware of

33:45.980 --> 33:47.240
Lord Xin'an's status.

33:47.240 --> 33:49.570
Even if he has unfortunately passed away,

33:49.770 --> 33:51.630
I still want to uncover the truth.

33:52.880 --> 33:53.530
Well...

33:57.440 --> 33:58.030
What?

34:00.110 --> 34:01.170
Don't want to help?

34:01.830 --> 34:02.680
How could I?

34:03.400 --> 34:05.600
I'm just trying to think of a way to help.

34:06.180 --> 34:06.980
I'm wondering

34:07.350 --> 34:09.190
if you have a personal letter from Lord Song?

34:09.190 --> 34:10.000
If you do,

34:10.030 --> 34:10.400
I can take it

34:10.400 --> 34:12.159
to the managers of other trading companies

34:12.159 --> 34:13.230
to have them join forces with me.

34:13.230 --> 34:14.199
This way,

34:14.230 --> 34:15.760
the search would be faster.

34:20.030 --> 34:22.159
So you think my rank isn't high enough.

34:22.280 --> 34:23.409
No, I wouldn't dare.

34:25.679 --> 34:28.000
Is the Grand Secretary of the imperial court high enough for you?

34:28.000 --> 34:29.199
The Grand Secretary?

34:30.020 --> 34:32.020
Let me be straightforward with you.

34:32.170 --> 34:34.030
There's another Chief Constable

34:34.070 --> 34:35.270
who came here with me.

34:35.480 --> 34:36.679
To be honest with you,

34:37.030 --> 34:38.070
he is the Grand Secretary's

34:38.070 --> 34:39.550
future son-in-law.

34:40.610 --> 34:41.969
If anything goes wrong,

34:42.360 --> 34:44.480
not only will you be unable to bear the consequences,

34:44.480 --> 34:45.940
even your boss, the owner,

34:46.290 --> 34:47.750
won't be able to handle it.

34:48.460 --> 34:50.540
May I ask which Grand Secretary it is?

34:50.880 --> 34:53.139
Is this something you can inquire about?

34:56.150 --> 34:57.440
First, a lord,

34:57.780 --> 34:59.980
now the Grand Secretary's son-in-law.

35:00.150 --> 35:01.940
I could ask Lord Song for instructions,

35:01.940 --> 35:02.690
however,

35:04.190 --> 35:05.800
I'm afraid it's not a letter that will be coming,

35:05.800 --> 35:06.600
but soldiers.

35:08.040 --> 35:08.800
By then,

35:09.140 --> 35:10.190
this Underground City

35:10.190 --> 35:11.850
will be thoroughly searched.

35:12.220 --> 35:13.820
If it affects your business,

35:15.800 --> 35:16.360
don't blame me

35:16.360 --> 35:18.090
for not warning you in advance.

35:20.110 --> 35:22.040
Thank you for the warning, My Lord.

35:31.610 --> 35:33.320
The son-in-law of a Grand Secretary?

35:33.320 --> 35:33.920
Yes.

35:34.820 --> 35:36.020
She wouldn't tell me

35:36.040 --> 35:37.140
which Grand Secretary specifically.

35:37.140 --> 35:39.800
I don't know whether what she said is true or not.

35:41.280 --> 35:43.790
What's that judicial commissioner's surname?

35:43.790 --> 35:44.440
Sima.

35:45.960 --> 35:46.920
Sima.

35:52.000 --> 35:52.880
Interesting.

35:54.490 --> 35:55.190
The time for the gate

35:55.190 --> 35:56.480
to Carefree Land to open

35:56.480 --> 35:57.410
is drawing near.

35:58.280 --> 35:59.480
The Underground City

35:59.650 --> 36:01.980
is indeed getting livelier and livelier.

36:03.550 --> 36:05.000
So, Master,

36:05.630 --> 36:06.690
should we help her?

36:06.760 --> 36:08.670
Of course we should help her.

36:10.190 --> 36:10.840
Chunmian.

36:12.190 --> 36:13.710
Assign more people to assist her.

36:13.710 --> 36:14.580
Once she's done with her antics,

36:14.580 --> 36:15.910
she'll leave on her own.

36:18.230 --> 36:20.090
Get rid of her as soon as possible.

36:20.920 --> 36:21.550
Yes.

36:38.120 --> 36:39.050
You said just now

36:39.070 --> 36:41.400
that you studied at Dexin Academy, right?

36:41.830 --> 36:43.030
How is that possible?

36:43.100 --> 36:44.630
Such a prestigious academy

36:44.630 --> 36:46.400
would never accept someone like me.

36:46.400 --> 36:48.330
Then what about that Master Zhang?

36:48.840 --> 36:50.240
There's no Master Zhang.

36:50.400 --> 36:51.710
I was just making it up.

36:52.640 --> 36:53.930
Besides, they took

36:53.960 --> 36:54.820
your bracelet.

36:55.680 --> 36:56.440
No matter where I said

36:56.440 --> 36:57.630
we came from,

36:57.800 --> 36:58.550
they would let us

36:58.550 --> 36:59.750
come in and have a try.

37:00.150 --> 37:01.000
That's true.

37:03.920 --> 37:06.120
So this is the last wonder of Guangping.

37:06.760 --> 37:09.000
But why is the Night Banquet at South Lake

37:09.000 --> 37:11.000
also considered one of the wonders?

37:11.730 --> 37:12.540
It's said that

37:12.850 --> 37:13.560
Lord Xin'an

37:13.590 --> 37:15.390
is the current emperor's uncle.

37:16.340 --> 37:18.210
When they came to this place years ago,

37:18.210 --> 37:20.500
they found it rich in talent and resources.

37:20.500 --> 37:21.830
So they invited poor scholars

37:21.830 --> 37:23.970
from various places to a banquet at the South Lake.

37:23.970 --> 37:25.280
As long as their poems and essays

37:25.280 --> 37:26.890
stood out at the gathering,

37:27.400 --> 37:28.590
they could drink and chat

37:28.590 --> 37:29.590
with Lord Xin'an.

37:30.630 --> 37:31.590
Even better,

37:32.040 --> 37:33.150
in the following year's imperial examination,

37:33.150 --> 37:34.920
they could achieve official ranks.

37:34.920 --> 37:37.650
That's why it became one of Guangping's wonders.

37:40.900 --> 37:42.760
So, do you know how to write poems?

37:52.400 --> 37:53.060
Gentlemen.

37:54.970 --> 37:57.080
I'm Liu Kuo, courtesy name Kefu.

37:57.110 --> 37:58.840
Pleased to meet you.

37:59.550 --> 38:00.480
May I ask

38:00.710 --> 38:02.570
how to address you two gentlemen?

38:04.430 --> 38:05.430
My surname is Jiu.

38:08.700 --> 38:09.660
Duan Yanqiu.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.030
Mr. Duan.

38:11.710 --> 38:12.360
Mr. Jiu.

38:13.480 --> 38:15.190
May I ask where you two are from

38:15.790 --> 38:17.520
and which academy you study at?

38:17.860 --> 38:19.160
We are from Guangping,

38:19.270 --> 38:20.880
and we study at Dexin Academy.

38:20.880 --> 38:21.800
Dexin Academy?

38:22.430 --> 38:23.960
So we are fellow disciples.

38:23.990 --> 38:25.990
No wonder you both look so familiar.

38:26.280 --> 38:27.090
May I ask,

38:27.380 --> 38:29.180
which master do you study under?

38:30.320 --> 38:31.120
Master Zhang.

38:31.760 --> 38:32.890
Master Zhang?

38:33.880 --> 38:35.920
You mean Zhang Maosong, Master Zhang?

38:35.920 --> 38:36.360
Yes.

38:36.920 --> 38:38.030
But hasn't Master Zhang

38:38.030 --> 38:39.400
been bedridden

38:39.550 --> 38:41.030
for a long time?

38:46.140 --> 38:48.060
We are his bedside disciples.

38:49.440 --> 38:50.270
Bedside?

38:52.920 --> 38:54.480
Pardon me for my ignorance.

38:54.710 --> 38:57.110
I've only heard of closed-door disciples.

39:17.480 --> 39:18.230
Mr. Liu.

39:18.630 --> 39:20.160
How long is this time limit?

39:20.630 --> 39:23.360
It counts as long as the incense is still burning.

39:35.070 --> 39:36.600
You know how to write poems?

39:38.920 --> 39:40.460
This Night Banquet at South Lake

39:40.460 --> 39:42.590
took place over a decade ago, right?

39:43.400 --> 39:44.130
Yes, indeed.

39:45.570 --> 39:46.760
Over the past 10 years,

39:46.760 --> 39:48.110
there have been no fewer than

39:48.110 --> 39:49.280
100 widely circulated new poems.

39:49.280 --> 39:50.960
Although I haven't deliberately memorized them,

39:50.960 --> 39:51.590
I could

39:51.880 --> 39:52.360
still recall

39:52.360 --> 39:53.360
two of them.

39:54.400 --> 39:57.060
And they definitely haven't heard them before.

40:53.720 --> 40:54.620
Why are you out?

41:01.770 --> 41:03.300
I'll fight you to the death!

41:38.860 --> 41:39.570
Today,

41:40.970 --> 41:41.920
even if you have to turn Guangping

41:41.920 --> 41:43.000
upside down,

41:43.280 --> 41:44.480
you must find

41:44.760 --> 41:46.840
those two people for me!

41:47.230 --> 41:47.880
Yes!

41:51.530 --> 41:52.710
His Lordship has read

41:52.710 --> 41:54.000
all the poems you wrote.

41:54.000 --> 41:55.000
He is very pleased

41:55.600 --> 41:57.630
and has specially awarded gold, silver, and valuables,

41:57.630 --> 41:58.880
as well as writing brushes, ink, paper, and inkstones

41:58.880 --> 42:00.630
to aid in your studies.

42:01.030 --> 42:03.760
He hopes you all will study extensively, think carefully,

42:03.760 --> 42:05.730
discern clearly, and act diligently.

42:05.730 --> 42:07.410
He also looks forward to seeing you all

42:07.410 --> 42:08.480
in the capital and achieve high honors

42:08.480 --> 42:11.310
in next year's imperial examination.

42:13.220 --> 42:14.430
Thank you, My Lord.

42:14.900 --> 42:15.760
Studying is for

42:15.920 --> 42:17.710
strengthening and revitalizing our country,

42:17.710 --> 42:19.000
and serving as an official is for

42:19.000 --> 42:20.730
ensuring peace for the people.

42:20.840 --> 42:23.670
This is the message bestowed upon you all by His Lordship.

42:23.670 --> 42:26.310
He hopes all of you will bear it in mind.

42:26.590 --> 42:28.030
We will bear it in mind.

42:29.320 --> 42:30.110
My Lord.

42:35.900 --> 42:38.560
Do you think there's anyone else from outside the painting here?

42:38.560 --> 42:39.410
Very likely.

42:40.190 --> 42:41.280
Upon this scene,

42:41.510 --> 42:42.670
and with this mood,

42:43.010 --> 42:45.080
I would like to recite a poem

42:45.110 --> 42:46.570
to present to His Lordship

42:47.590 --> 42:48.710
and everyone here.

42:51.110 --> 42:54.110
Ten years of study by rain-beaten lamplight.

42:55.020 --> 42:58.220
At the top of a hundred-foot pole, watching the tide rise.

42:58.470 --> 43:01.730
A thousand sails finally cross, with ambitions soaring high.

43:01.730 --> 43:05.980
Ten thousand miles of blue waves reflect the red sun.

43:06.450 --> 43:07.590
Bravo! What a great poem!

43:07.590 --> 43:08.670
Wonderful poem! Truly a magnificent piece!

43:08.670 --> 43:09.670
Excellent poem!

43:10.150 --> 43:11.150
What a great poem!

43:12.050 --> 43:13.490
As expected of you, Kefu.

43:13.670 --> 43:16.130
Your literary talent is indeed remarkable.

43:16.550 --> 43:18.200
My skills are not worth mentioning.

43:18.200 --> 43:20.930
There are many talents from humble backgrounds,

43:21.210 --> 43:22.410
such as Mr. Duan here.

43:23.100 --> 43:24.360
Despite his young age,

43:24.480 --> 43:25.830
he's very accomplished at composing poetry,

43:25.830 --> 43:27.510
even better than me.

43:29.840 --> 43:30.270
Me?

43:31.070 --> 43:31.800
Yes, indeed.

43:32.000 --> 43:33.090
I saw Mr. Duan

43:33.190 --> 43:34.360
pick up his brush to compose a poem just now,

43:34.360 --> 43:36.190
and he finished it with just a few strokes,

43:36.190 --> 43:37.800
showing his quick wit.

43:39.890 --> 43:41.120
You're too kind.

43:43.230 --> 43:45.280
Mr. Duan, there's no need to be so modest.

43:45.280 --> 43:47.140
With His Lordship present today,

43:47.480 --> 43:50.080
Mr. Duan, why don't you compose another piece?

43:50.440 --> 43:51.800
That's right, no need to be modest.

43:51.800 --> 43:52.420
Compose another piece. One more.

43:52.420 --> 43:53.550
Compose another piece. One more.
